# Page layout (canonical: Sales / Purchases)

Use the sales stack for every domain list/settings page.

## List pages

```
AppShell
  └─ DomainListPage  (or same structure by hand)
       ├─ PageHeader — title + description (+ CTA)
       ├─ KpiGrid
       ├─ FilterSearch (+ optional SubNav via belowToolbar)
       └─ DataTable in zarva-glass-card + zarva-scrollbar
            footer: total (+ prev/next when paged)
```

Canonical refs:
- `features/sales/sales-list-page.tsx`
- `features/purchases/purchases-list-page.tsx`
- `components/page/domain-list-page.tsx`
- `components/page/page-header.tsx`

## Detail / settings cards

Same `AppShell` + `PageHeader` (title + description). Content in `.zarva-glass-card`. No inventing a second header component.

## Rules

- Description under the title is required for domain hubs (explain the page)
- Tables: `DataTable` + `.zarva-scrollbar` only — never hand-rolled `jaryan-*` classes
- Icons: Solar via `<Icon />` (see `icons.mdc`)
